00:05:08.533 --> 00:05:12.500
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.199
I am going to blank an internship.

92
00:05:15.499 --> 00:05:18.664
A, seek. B, seeking. C, sought.

93
00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.991
The answer is A: seek.

94
00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.496
A document listing your education and experience is a blank.

95
00:05:28.796 --> 00:05:32.635
A, resume. B, mentor. C, network.

96
00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.874
The answer is A: resume.

97
00:05:39.017 --> 00:05:42.235
A skill that is useful in many jobs is a blank skill.

98
00:05:42.535 --> 00:05:46.537
A, transferable. B, professional. C, career.

99
00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.285
The answer is A: transferable.

100
00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:57.081
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

101
00:05:57.917 --> 00:06:00.787
What steps can you take now to plan your future career?

102
00:06:09.583 --> 00:06:11.026
